  body: |
    # Beneficial capital ownership in the ESA(IR) source

    ## Authored interpretation

    The source distinguishes capital held beneficially from the name in which it is held and limits capital treatment to the beneficial interest.

    ## Scope and boundaries

    DMG 52001 limits this chapter’s capital effect to ESA(IR), not ESA(Cont). Joint interests, trusts, capacity and particular assets need separate evidence. No ownership decision or Pension Credit capital equivalence is asserted.

    ## Inspected source passages

    - [DMG 52001, PDF page 2](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69d8f30ad3e08b8871b665ac/dmg-Ch-52.pdf#page=2)
    - [DMG 52070, PDF page 8](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69d8f30ad3e08b8871b665ac/dmg-Ch-52.pdf#page=8)
    - [DMG 52071, PDF page 8](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69d8f30ad3e08b8871b665ac/dmg-Ch-52.pdf#page=8)
    - [DMG 52072, PDF page 8](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69d8f30ad3e08b8871b665ac/dmg-Ch-52.pdf#page=8)

